    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ag2WDdcT1Ga5RNkKc538jDdq7OrsfxQ8SrysJhBfmQs.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned} \\mathrm{E} & =\\frac{\\sigma}{2 \\varepsilon_0} \\\\ \\tau & =\\mathrm{PE} \\sin \\theta\\end{aligned}$<br/>$\\begin{aligned} & =\\left[\\left(2 \\times 10^{-6}\\right)\\left(\\frac{2}{10}\\right)\\right]\\left[\\frac{100 \\times 10^{-6}}{2 \\times 8.85 \\times 10^{-12}}\\right]\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\\\ & =\\frac{10}{8.85}=1.12 \\mathrm{Nm}\\end{aligned}$",
